{"title":"2015 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/5/ae5d52c6031f0bfb4a2744007721a5a49e2677fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=2x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" />, determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/0/1400d7bb6eb328602e3dad64adedb6864c7099a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f(3))^2+2(f(3))+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"168\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add0cdf8706e0bfd05e0d85c0f3bb080d1d340e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 2x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/e/25e4bd94caa267f53165a067bafd4a8d1072212c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) = 2 \\times 3 - 1 = 6 - 1 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"230\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/0/c30a322156ca867f359855b2a50e12f530e0418f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/0/1400d7bb6eb328602e3dad64adedb6864c7099a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f(3))^2+2(f(3))+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"168\" height=\"21\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/3/71398e888fbd578afab2b52c5439346c41ab40fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{2} + 2 \\times 5 + 1 = 25 + 10 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"226\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/1/3717a5d2bd20ce0faacab4a13b13c4443b86109a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=35 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2c39440d20609c4d91133a4a574f22f6db9b9ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"50\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>We could have also realized that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a9677190bad73aecd809a73dcf2a452fdce6c23b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f(3))^{2} + 2(f(3)) + 1 = (f(3) + 1)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"280\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/2/892e1021b66f5cd1a9d8a573744f8672f80d4077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f(3) + 1)^{2} = (5 + 1)^{2} = 6^{2} = \\boxed{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"270\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017133231\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 47/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2121/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.671      1 2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.671      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36014:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017133231 and revision id 279631. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}